<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Manager Dashboard | Car Deals</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="role-shell">
        <aside class="role-sidebar">
            <a class="brand-mark" href="/manager"><span class="brand-icon">CD</span><span>Car Deals<small>Manager desk</small></span></a>
            <p class="sidebar-label">Workspace</p>
            <nav class="sidebar-nav" aria-label="Manager navigation">
                <a class="sidebar-link active" href="/manager">Overview</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/car_types">Car types</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/clients">Clients</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/employees">Employees</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/sales">Sales</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/suppliers">Suppliers</a>
                <a class="sidebar-link" href="/latest">Latest additions</a>
            </nav>
            <a class="sidebar-logout logout-button" href="/logout">Log out</a>
        </aside>
        <main class="role-content">
            <div class="role-topline"><div><p class="eyebrow">MANAGER WORKSPACE</p><h1>Welcome back, Manager</h1><p class="role-intro">Keep the showroom moving with a clear view of your daily operations.</p></div><div class="role-date">Today’s command center</div></div>
            <section class="role-hero manager-hero"><div><span class="hero-kicker">ON THE ROAD TO BETTER DEALS</span><h2>Make every handoff count.</h2><p>Review inventory, connect with clients, and keep every sale on course.</p></div></section>
            <section class="role-cards" aria-label="Manager shortcuts">
                <a class="role-card" href="/car_types"><strong>Inventory</strong><small>Manage car types</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/clients"><strong>Clients</strong><small>View your customers</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/employees"><strong>Employees</strong><small>Manage employee records</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/sales"><strong>Sales</strong><small>Track transactions</small></a>
                <a class="role-card" href="/suppliers"><strong>Suppliers</strong><small>Manage supplier records</small></a>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>